      "side": 1,
      "message": "This change will make the API implementation asynchronous and the Apps may not expect this. For example, they would expect the callback to be unregistered as soon as this API returns. \n\nInstead could we add synchronized blocks to protect mTbsGeneric so that stop() and unregisterBearer() can be called at the same time?",
