      "writtenOn": "2022-03-03T08:36:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the root cause is \n\nmTbsGeneric.mTbsGatt is set to null when mTbsGeneric.cleanup() is called from TbsService.stop(). \n\nAt the same time, if we try to call unregisterBearer(), which will call mTbsGeneric.removeBearer(token), which will call notifyCclc(), which will call mTbsGeneric.mTbsGatt.XXXX, and will generate NPE. \n\nI think a good solution would be making methods in mTbsGeneric synchronized and remove all the bearers in mTbsGeneric when cleanup() is called",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 293,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 293,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "972b0dcc3a09cc07dd65efdc362c715759855642",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
